# NOTE: do NOT ignore .env / .env.* / *.env here. The Emergent deploy build
# context is built from the repo, so ignoring them ships a container with a
# STALE environment (this has already caused live Razorpay keys to be missing
# in production three times: payments then fail with "Authentication failed"
# and the app shows "Couldn't start checkout · HTTP 502"). Verify with
# `git check-ignore -v backend/.env` — it must print nothing.
